  "_encounters": "Combat encounters by the DMG 2024 (PDF pages 118-119): budget is the XP Budget per Character, [Low, Moderate, High] for levels 1 to 20. A band met in the land is built for the land, not the party (DESIGN.md: some fights should be avoided): danger_level is the party level a region's danger (0-10) stands for; odds how often a band is built Low, Moderate or High; the budget is per character in the party; a band never loses the last of any kind in it, and grows at most to most_extra times its largest roll. How a band looks to the player: below Low, Low, Moderate, High, and deadly above deadly times High.",
